  "label": "Hulk Hogan is mapped as the speaker of the confrontational monologue",
  "description": "The text 'well let me tell you something brother' is directly associated with Hulk Hogan's visual portrayal. His iconic pose and persona are used to represent the speaker of this monologue, creating an analogical mapping where the visual entity (Hulk Hogan) is mapped onto the textual entity (the speaker of the monologue). This is reinforced by the background knowledge that this phrase is a signature catchphrase of Hulk Hogan's wrestling persona.",
